tage) Operations and maintenance 90.00 Apr/2017 83.00 30-Jan-2026 83.00 30-Jan-2026 100.00 Oct/2026 costs of coastal WSPs Comments on This is from the previous IMPACT report. The number will be updated with the next IMPACT benefiting from the project achieving targets report recovered from customers. (Percentage) Septic sludge treatment 0.00 Apr/2017 0.00 30-Jan-2026 0.00 30-Jan-2026 4.00 Oct/2026 facilities constructed under Comments on Construction ongoing. Expected to be complete by August 2026 the project (Number) achieving targets Component 3: National performance-based financing (US$83.6 million of which IDA-SUF US$76 million).", "url": "https://documents.worldbank.org/curated/en/099031226003019207/pdf/P156634-4691aab6-8be2-47be-a151-186b5d20a1b3.pdf#page=6", "published": "2026-03-12", "date_known": true, "observed": null, "location": null, "image_urls": [], "author": "World Bank", "read_on": "2026-11-05", "team": null, "notice": null}, "highlights": []}

